			"notes": "mod version 0.3.5\n\n**Improved blocks textures**\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"200\" alt=\"Block Textures\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/788f8a7b-3014-490f-811e-3a4a3586e9af\" />\n\n**Improved blocks GUI:**\n\nready to pay\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Снимок экрана 2026-03-29 150016\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f077059d-581c-4b00-af08-ca44c8997261\" />\n\npayment complete\n<img width=\"300\" height=\"160\" alt=\"Снимок экрана 2026-03-29 150029\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cddad449-d6af-4566-84a7-193ecb9a2bb0\" />\n\n\nThe ATM has been renamed Card Linker to reflect its purpose."
