			"notes": "<img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" alt=\"ATM_Craft\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9ef76db5-d3f6-4b5f-8ef5-e346c797bf47\" />\n<img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" alt=\"Card_Craft\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d19bc7c8-8a5f-49fc-9a3c-14a329427786\" />\n<img width=\"250\" height=\"250\" alt=\"Terminal_Craft\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b824ced4-5958-4204-91be-3b3d1ab31ffb\" />\n\nCheck [this example of site](https://github.com/RealDodik/ExampleBank_For_MyATM) which support MyATM Mod.\nLicense - MIT\n\n\nHow to Setup:\n1) Run your banking site with MyATM support.\n2) Put MyATM.jar in \"mods\" folder\n3) Run the game and enter first word\n4) Put your bank_name, site_link and api_password (Check README in [example site](https://github.com/RealDodik/ExampleBank_For_MyATM)), from site to myATM.cfg.\n(Example: 'GLTest':'https://gltest.pythonanywhere.com':'Awh5SJJ34nG')\n5) Restart the game.\n6) Rename your ATM on anvil to Bank_Name from myATM.cfg and place it.\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"ATM_Rename_Example\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/90e02215-909e-4330-93e1-78e9b5c478f5\" />\n\n7) Rename your Terminal to Bank_Name=Account_Nomber_From_Site (Example: GLBank=486044) and place it.\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Termina_Rename_Example\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f09e6eb5-6993-4d20-acc8-5c2fe3a97510\" />\n\n8) Profit\n\nHow to use:\n1) Create account on site.\n2) Put blank card into ATM\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Card_Linking\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d8b792ae-5db5-4443-9bce-da99bcb4097a\" />\n\n3) Use you account data (Login and Password) and create PIN in ATM. It create card linked to your account.\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Card_Linked\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b00fd7ae-6406-4b2c-a784-52c173fc21b5\" />\n\n4) Put your card in Terminal, enter amount and PIN to pay.\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Paymetn_Ready\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5143ef56-81f7-45de-b941-c53dfe505fe4\" />\n<img width=\"400\" height=\"400\" alt=\"Payment_Done\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8fab98d-be0a-4979-998c-1a05fdd03251\" />\n\n5) Profit.\n<img width=\"1879\" height=\"1003\" alt=\"Profile_On_Example_Site\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/957366f8-5078-4233-9ae7-6f7737b53ec7\" />\n\n\n\nIn 0.3.2:\n1) Multiple banks via 1 mod. (add new lines with 'bank_name':'site_link':'api_password' in myATM.cfg)\n2) Simple in-game payment.\n\n\nIn future:\n1) Improved block textures.\n2) Simplified addition of new currencies (currently only through code changes).\n3) Replace green text in ATM with clear notification.\n4) Multiple cards on one account.\n5) Deposits via ATM.\n6) Fabric fork."
